302
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:51,290
Aku memungutnya di gunung.

303
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,520
Mesin ini milik paman.

304
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:11,449
Di atasnya tertulis kantor paman.

305
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:12,639
Kalian jangan bermain di sini lagi.

306
00:34:12,639 --> 00:34:13,520
Pulanglah.

307
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:16,880
Apa yang kamu lakukan? Aku tendang kamu, percaya tidak?

308
00:34:16,880 --> 00:34:17,760
Pulang.
